Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, python3 (>= 3.14), python3 (<< 3.15), postgresql-18, postgresql-18-pgvector, libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, zlib1g
Description: local-first MCP/RAG memory for AI agents
 Local Optimize provides scoped PostgreSQL/pgvector retrieval, GraphRAG,
 local Intel XPU reranking and local-only Ollama/MCP integration.
 .
 This package installs application files, the Python 3.14 Intel XPU runtime,
 pinned RAG models and qwen2.5-coder:7b for the system Ollama service.
 User services remain inactive until secrets and projects are configured.
